  "tags": [
    "x-monorepo",
    "otel"
  ],
  "description": "RED view of one deployable (job = service.name): Connect RPCs, use cases, plain HTTP routes, worker eventbus lag, Go runtime, WARN/ERROR logs. Source: deployments/docker/grafana/dashboards/rpc.json.",
