      "title": "Consumer lag (unacked messages)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "description": "eventbus_consumer_lag: messages past the group's cursor that the subscriber could read now. Postgres: outbox rows below the snapshot xmin; Redis: XINFO lag + pending. In redis mode the forwarder group is the outbox \u2192 stream hop.",
