      "id": 34,
      "title": "Orders by status",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "description": "ordering_orders{status}: every order in the ordering BC by status. PENDING is waiting for inventory's answer (StockReserved \u2192 CONFIRMED, shortfall \u2192 CANCELLED); a PENDING count that does not drain while CONFIRMED / CANCELLED stand still is a broken saga \u2014 check consumer lag on ordering.v1.OrderCreated and inventory.v1.StockReserved, then the poison tables.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 41,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "max by (status)(ordering_orders{job=\"$service\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{status}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
